- Preserved the original `__all__` list (14 public names; `on_attach`/`_on_unload` remain defined but unexported, matching R's internal `.onAttach`/`.onUnload` hooks).
- Verified with `py_compile` and a runtime smoke test exercising the full dependency chain (`dpill` → `rlbin`/`cpblock`/`blkest`/`locpoly`/`sdiag`/`sstdiag`).
